<title>UK: EIB sets 10 billion peseta four-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 10 billion peseta four-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following four-tranche bond was announced by lead manager la Caixa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    2.5 BLN PTA   COUPON     4.3	 MATURITY    03.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.10</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION PRICE IS 85 PCT NOMINAL VALUE PLUS</p>
<p>		**VARIABLE AMOUNT</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    2.5 BLN PTA   COUPON     4.32	MATURITY    04.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.10</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION PRICE IS 84.86 PCT NOMINAL VALUE PLUS</p>
<p>		**VARIABLE AMOUNT</p>
<p>TRANCHE C</p>
<p> AMT    2.5 BLN PTA   COUPON     4.34	MATURITY    07.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.10</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMTION PRICE IS 84.73 PCT NOMINAL VALUE PLUS</p>
<p>	  **VARIABLE AMOUNT</p>
<p>TRANCHE D</p>
<p> AMT    2.5 BLN PTA   COUPON     4.36 PCT  MATURITY    08.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.10	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION PRICE IS 84.59 PCT NOMINAL VALUE PLUS</p>
<p>		**VARIABLE AMOUNT</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   DENOMS (M) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	VARIABLE AMOUNT IS LINKED TO A COMPLICATED FORMULA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
